16.6.252.m:
One should not heed this;
"one should not heed it" is the established rule.
This day is free of the anuṣṭubh meter.

16.7.254.m:
mentally he sings the udgītha;
mentally he responds;
mentally they say to the hotṛ priest, "This is the last [verse]."

Mentally the hotṛ priest calls;
mentally the adhvaryu priest makes the counter-call;
mentally he recites;

16.10.257.m:
The second begins with the Śukra cup;
the third and fourth begin with the Āgrayaṇa cup;
the fifth day begins with the cup for Indra and Vāyu;

the sixth and seventh begin with the Śukra cup;
the eighth day begins with the Āgrayaṇa cup;
the ninth and tenth begin with the cup for Indra and Vāyu.

17.6.287.m:
The adhvaryu priest turns away from the place of the hotṛ priest.
The hotṛ priest calls to him;
the adhvaryu priest makes the counter-call.
